        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Aries &mdash; 3rd (Cloth Ability) Technique, gained at level 11.</em></p><p><em>A net woven by psychokinetic power that traps the adversary and completely inhibits their mobility.</em></p><p>Each creature in the area must attempt a Reflex save.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> It is restrained until the end of its next turn.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> It is immobilized for 1 minute (Escape DC equal to your Cosmo DC).</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, and it takes @Damage[6d8[force]] damage.</p><p>A creature that Escapes shatters its portion of the net.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> The damage increases by 1d8 and the burst by 5 feet.</p><p>On a day your constellation is <strong>Ascendant</strong> this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a <strong>Zenith</strong>, 8 levels higher.</p>"
